  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Routes of Enslaved Peoples: Resistance, Liberty and Heritage project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the continuation of the actions developed these past decades through UNESCO&apos;s Routes of Enslaved Peoples project, and in view of the ongoing persistence of racist attacks perpetrated against people of African descent in Europe, UNESCO will conduct activities that will catalyse action to combat the harmful legacies of enslavement and the slave trade. The activities will foster a better comprehension of these legacies and seek good practices pertaining to the fight against racism and discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
